# AquaPure Privacy Policy

**Last updated:** October 24, 2026

AquaPure provides information about water-purifier products and related services.

## Information We Collect

AquaPure may collect information that users voluntarily provide, such as their name, email address, contact details, and order-related information when applicable.

## How We Use Information

We use collected information to provide product information, manage orders and service requests, and improve the user experience.

## Google Sheets Integration

Our internal automation may use Google Sheets to read product information for preparing promotional content. Access is limited to the permissions granted by the account owner.

## Data Sharing and Security

We do not sell personal information. We take reasonable steps to protect information from unauthorized access.

## Contact

For privacy-related questions, contact the AquaPure website administrator through the contact details provided on our website.
